    "long_instructions": "### **Generate with AI**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Plan:** In `prompt.md`, write a prompt that asks AI to:\r\n   - add a **second decision** to your app (Sword or Shield)  \r\n   - use a **nested conditional** so the outcome depends on the path chosen **and** the item chosen \r\n   - show a **different image for each combination** (4 total outcomes)\r\n\r\n2. **Build:** Use AI to generate the code for your **nested conditional**.\r\n\r\n3. **Test:** Try all 4 combinations to make sure each one shows a **unique result**:\r\n   - Forest + Sword  \r\n   - Forest + Shield  \r\n   - Road + Sword  \r\n   - Road + Shield  \r\n"
  },
